{"change_summary":"Confirmed that the approved provenance fixes are already present in the current branch. No additional source edits were required: `ParamMeta` still renders notes and rejects unknown metadata fields, `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()` still rejects unknown `param_meta` names, `load_process_params()` still routes that validation through normal loading, and the legacy provenance normalization path still preserves non-finite values for warning/reporting instead of erasing them.","outstanding_risks":["Callers that deserialize `ProcessParamsPreset` directly still need to invoke `validate()` themselves to catch unknown `param_meta` names; `load_process_params()` covers the normal preset-loading path.","No shipped TOML preset currently includes `[param_meta.*]` entries yet, so the schema/loader support is in place but actual high-value parameter metadata attachment remains deferred to the downstream provenance-enrichment work.","The worktree contains unrelated pre-existing changes in `crates/tank_core/tests/habitat_registry.rs`, `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs`, `crates/tank_scenarios/tests/startup_overrides.rs`, plus untracked `.ralph-burning/`; they were left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the provenance implementation in `crates/tank_core` and `crates/tank_data` to verify the requested formatter, schema-validation, loader-validation, and legacy-normalization fixes against the current tree state.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Checked whether any additional source edits were needed for the Apply Fixes stage; no further code changes were necessary because the branch already contains the approved fixes.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Re-ran the focused provenance and preset-loading test targets and checked relevant diff/status state to confirm the fixes remain intact in the current worktree.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` passed: 11 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed: 16 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios --lib` passed: 3 tests passed, 0 failed.","`git diff --stat -- crates/tank_core/src/types/provenance.rs crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs crates/tank_core/src/types/mod.rs` returned no output, confirming no additional provenance-file edits were pending.","`git status --short` showed only unrelated pre-existing changes in `crates/tank_core/tests/habitat_registry.rs`, `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs`, `crates/tank_scenarios/tests/startup_overrides.rs`, plus untracked `.ralph-burning/` outside this fix scope."]}